description: "ALPHA VERSION \n\nThere is NO playable campaign right now! It's a WIP mod! \n«New planet, new stuff, what a surprise» \n© [#5865f2[]]@nyledekare[white[]] \n\nMight be dependent on FICO lib. \n\nSpecial thanks to: \n— [#d9c289[]]Ace[white[]] ([#5865f2[]]@ace1020spawn[white[]]) & [#89bbd9[]]Cirrus[white[]] ([#5865f2[]]@cirrusisakey[white[]]) for cool music; \n— [#5865f2[]]@photon_gravity[white[]] for AdjustableBeamNode (diagonal beam nodes); \n— [#5865f2[]]@meepoffaith[white[]] for the pseudo-3D drawing code; \n— [#adf0e8[]]Sputnuc[white[]] ([#5865f2[]]@sputnuc.[white[]]) for AdvancedArtilleryBulletType; \n— [#5865f2[]]@nyledekare[white[]] for original mod. \nOther help (code, sprites, etc): ItzCraft, WeεrsΙχ?, Sputnuc, Cirrus."

